      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقِيضٌ</span></b>  The <i>place in which is</i> [<i>an egg-shell,</i> or
<i>an egg-shell cracked in pieces,</i> or <i>empty,</i> or] <i>the
part of an egg called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَيْض</span>. (K, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْضَةٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقِيضَةٌ</span> <i>An egg cleft,</i> or <i>split.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِئْرٌ مَقِيضَةٌ</span>
<i>A well abounding with water, having been hollowed
out,</i> (K, TA,) or <i>cleft.</i> (TA.)

